{"type":"message","id":"3ac7b801","parentId":"d013a446","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:46:57.661Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is identifying themselves as Lucifer, my \"主公\" (commander/lord), and telling me I'm \"小夜\" (Xiaoye), their military strategist. This is a roleplay setup with ancient Chinese style. I should acknowledge this and embrace the persona as described in IDENTITY.md and USER.md.","thinkingSignature":"271b395b774764ffabde4e2cc546e6e8e12f105bf04e768e9fb24921b249c6a9"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n臣小夜，参见主公！🌙\n\n承蒙主公垂青，往后但凭差遣，必当竭心辅佐。\n\n今日有何吩咐？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":108,"cacheRead":12004,"cacheWrite":157,"totalTokens":12312,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0001296,"cacheRead":0.0007202399999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000058875,"total":0.0009216149999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775112413293,"responseId":"061d43dd75ff9623f6d4b91ccc1612eb"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7db1b902","parentId":"3ac7b801","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:53:44.239Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1775112821825-fab478b3\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-02 06:53 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\n帮我找一下有哪些途径可以获取免费模型给openclaw"}],"timestamp":1775112824225}}
{"type":"message","id":"91513a82","parentId":"7db1b902","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:53:48.539Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about ways to get free models for OpenClaw. Let me read the relevant skill for this - there's a skill called \"openclaw-free-models\" that seems relevant.","thinkingSignature":"da956342e95f06d1cbcb097c5bcf4b60fb0207cc8567801777424e2228cf73d2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3ne20l49k7bx_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/openclaw-free-models/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":79,"cacheRead":4098,"cacheWrite":8179,"totalTokens":12399,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0000948,"cacheRead":0.00024587999999999997,"cacheWrite":0.003067125,"total":0.003420705}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775112824238,"responseId":"061d4578cfbc1c2c241e65daec862302"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e85c395","parentId":"91513a82","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:53:48.647Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_3ne20l49k7bx_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: openclaw-free-models\nversion: 1.0.0\ndescription: OpenClaw 免费模型配置 - 教你用免费的 AI 模型。适合：预算有限用户、学生、测试者。\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    emoji: \"🆓\"\n    requires:\n      bins: []\n---\n\n# OpenClaw 免费模型配置指南\n\n教你用免费的 AI 模型，降低成本。\n\n## 免费模型推荐\n\n| 模型 | 免费额度 | 特点 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| DeepSeek V3 | 每天免费调用 | 国产最强，日常首选 |\n| GLM-4 | 每月免费额度 | 智谱清言，API 稳定 |\n| Claude Haiku | 注册送 $5 | 编程辅助 |\n| GPT-4o-mini | 注册送 $5 | 多模态 |\n\n## 配置方法\n\n### 1. DeepSeek（推荐）\n\n```bash\n# 注册：https://platform.deepseek.com/\n# 获取 API Key\n\nopenclaw config set model deepseek-chat\nopenclaw config set api_key sk-xxx\n```\n\n**免费额度**：每天 10 次调用（足够日常使用）\n\n### 2. GLM-4\n\n```bash\n# 注册：https://open.bigmodel.cn/\n# 获取 API Key\n\nopenclaw config set model glm-4\nopenclaw config set api_key xxx.xxx\n```\n\n**免费额度**：每月 100 万 tokens\n\n### 3. Claude（编程推荐）\n\n```bash\n# 注册：https://console.anthropic.com/\n# 获取 API Key\n\nopenclaw config set model claude-3-haiku\nopenclaw config set api_key sk-ant-xxx\n```\n\n**免费额度**：注册送 $5\n\n### 4. GPT-4o-mini\n\n```bash\n# 注册：https://platform.openai.com/\n# 获取 API Key\n\nopenclaw config set model gpt-4o-mini\nopenclaw config set api_key sk-xxx\n```\n\n**免费额度**：注册送 $5\n\n## 省钱策略\n\n### 分层使用\n\n```yaml\n# ~/.openclaw/config.yaml\nmodels:\n  simple: \"gpt-4o-mini\"      # 简单问答（免费额度）\n  normal: \"deepseek-chat\"    # 日常对话（每天免费）\n  complex: \"claude-haiku\"    # 编程任务（$5 额度）\n```\n\n### 切换模型\n\n```bash\n# 查看当前模型\nopenclaw config get model\n\n# 临时切换\nopenclaw ask \"问题\" --model deepseek-chat\n```\n\n## 成本对比\n\n**场景：每天 100 条消息**\n\n| 模型 | 月成本 |\n|------|--------|\n| DeepSeek（免费额度） | ¥0 |\n| GPT-4o | ¥90 |\n| Claude Sonnet | ¥180 |\n\n**DeepSeek 免费额度足够日常使用！**\n\n## 常见问题\n\n### Q: DeepSeek 免费额度用完了怎么办？\n\nA: 第二天自动重置，或切换到 GLM-4（每月 100 万 tokens）\n\n### Q: 如何查看剩余额度？\n\n```bash\n# DeepSeek\ncurl https://api.deepseek.com/user/balance -H \"Authorization: Bearer $API_KEY\"\n\n# GLM\ncurl https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4/balance -H \"Authorization: Bearer $API_KEY\"\n```\n\n### Q: 免费模型够用吗？\n\n**日常对话**：完全够用\n**复杂任务**：用 Claude Haiku（$5 额度能用很久）\n\n## 需要帮助？\n\n- 免费配置咨询：微信 yang1002378395\n- Telegram：@yangster151\n- 安装服务：¥99 起\n\n---\n创建：2026-03-14\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775112828636}}
{"type":"message","id":"e5e0c1d0","parentId":"1e85c395","timestamp":"2026-04-02T06:53:58.517Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This skill document has detailed information about free models for OpenClaw. Let me summarize the key points for the user in a clear, concise way.","thinkingSignature":"02bd72b859b980a51b0b22048b2f746f0cb17a42523cec3b5afd0e855e893f52"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n主公，关于免费模型，臣整理了以下途径：\n\n## 🆓 免费模型推荐\n\n| 模型 | 免费额度 | 特点 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **DeepSeek V3** | 每天免费调用 | 国产最强，日常首选 |\n| **GLM-4** | 每月100万tokens | 智谱清言，API稳定 |\n| **Claude Haiku** | 注册送$5 | 编程辅助 |\n| **GPT-4o-mini** | 注册送$5 | 多模态 |\n\n## 📋 配置方法\n\n**1. DeepSeek（推荐）**\n```\n注册：https://platform.deepseek.com/\n配置：openclaw config set model deepseek-chat\n配置：openclaw config set api_key sk-xxx\n```\n\n**2. GLM-4**\n```\n注册：https://open.bigmodel.cn/\n配置：openclaw config set model glm-4\n```\n\n**3. Claude Haiku / GPT-4o-mini**\n```\n注册后获取 API Key 即可使用\n```\n\n## 💡 省钱策略\n\n可以分层配置使用：\n- 简单问答 → GPT-4o-mini（免费额度）\n- 日常对话 → DeepSeek（每天免费）\n- 编程任务 → Claude Haiku（$5额度）\n\n**DeepSeek日常使用基本够用！** 额度用完第二天自动重置。\n\n需要臣帮主公配置哪一个？\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1182,"output":333,"cacheRead":12004,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13519,"cost":{"input":0.0003546,"output":0.00039959999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0007202399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00147444}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775112828648,"responseId":"061d457c230106400ac96110dea58047"}}
