{"type":"message","id":"3770e814","parentId":"a82d8319","timestamp":"2026-04-02T07:08:56.601Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to configure DeepSeek. I should guide them through the process. But I need an API key from them to configure it. Let me ask for it.","thinkingSignature":"cba02033816500b43186d73196ff1305a4ee34294514797327e32af321cdb764"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n好的，需要主公提供两样东西：\n\n1. **DeepSeek API Key**（从 https://platform.deepseek.com/ 注册获取）\n2. **API Key 的 API Key 值**（格式：`sk-xxx`）\n\n获取方式：\n1. 访问 https://platform.deepseek.com/\n2. 注册/登录账号\n3. 进入「API Keys」页面\n4. 创建一个新的 API Key\n\n拿到后发给臣，臣帮主公配置上。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":140,"cacheRead":4098,"cacheWrite":9370,"totalTokens":13651,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.000168,"cacheRead":0.00024587999999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00351375,"total":0.00394053}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775113731141,"responseId":"061d4903a62ecc9ac8e5e4fc750dacd0"}}
